@startuml expense-state
' Expense lifecycle state machine (Claude proposal). See design.md section 4.3.
title SplitSmart - Expense Lifecycle
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : submit\n[valid; shares reconcile]

state PENDING {
  [*] --> AwaitingDesignation : no eligible standing reviewer
  [*] --> AwaitingDecision : standing reviewer set\nand != submitter
  AwaitingDesignation --> AwaitingDecision : manager designates reviewer\n[active member, != submitter]
  AwaitingDecision --> AwaitingDecision : manager re-designates\n(e.g. reviewer removed)
}
PENDING : excluded from balances (FR-006)
PENDING : shown as "Pending" (NFR-004)

PENDING --> APPROVED : approve\n[caller == designated reviewer;\nversion matches]\n/ post ledger entries
PENDING --> REJECTED : reject\n[caller == designated reviewer;\nversion matches]

APPROVED : included in pairwise balances (FR-008)
APPROVED : terminal
REJECTED : never affects balances
REJECTED : terminal; resubmission creates\na NEW expense (OQ-13)

APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  FULL PRODUCT: stays PENDING until
  ApprovalPolicy.isSatisfied() for all
  configured levels; any rejection -> REJECTED
  (OQ-31). MVP has exactly one level.
end note
@enduml
